    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Over-the-counter topical terbinafine is fungicidal and allows shorter courses; econazole or ciclopirox may be better if candidal infection can't be excluded; clotrimazole and miconazole are other OTC options"
     }
    ]
   },
